          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Does Singapore tax capital gains or stock dividends?</h3>
            <p>No. Singapore has 0% capital gains tax and operates a single-tier corporate tax framework where corporate dividends paid to shareholders are tax-exempt.</p>
          </div>
